<Base title="About"><Heading label="An autobiography in progress" title="Learning by building. Growing by contributing." description="I’m Varshith Sai Ulisi. My story connects two school communities, an interest in how things work, and a growing sense of responsibility for what I build."/><section class="about-personal" data-reveal><img src={path('images/varshith-ulisi.png')} alt="Portrait of Varshith Sai Ulisi" width="800" height="800"/><div><p class="eyebrow">Hello, I’m Varshith.</p><h2>I’m still figuring things out.<br/><em>And building as I go.</em></h2><p>I’m interested in what happens when a question becomes an idea, and an idea becomes something that helps another person. This is the story behind the projects, the lessons, and the people I’m learning from.</p><a class="small-link" href={linkedin}>Connect with me on LinkedIn ↗</a></div></section><div class="reading-layout"><aside class="toc">{chapters.map(([id,title])=><a href={`#${id}`}>{title}</a>)}<a href={path('resources/')}>Professional resources ↗</a><a href={path('about/timeline/')}>View the timeline ↗</a><a href={path('biography.txt')} download>Download my biography ↓</a></aside><article class="prose">{chapters.map(([id,title,...paragraphs])=><section><h2 id={id}>{title}</h2>{paragraphs.map(p=><p>{p}</p>)}</section>)}<p class="note">Adapted from my first-person reflections in the supplied brag sheet, especially pp. 16–27. This edited account preserves the documented experiences; it does not add childhood scenes, dialogue, or unrecorded events.</p><h2>Education & interests</h2><p>Mason High School, class of 2027. My academic interests include entrepreneurship, economics, finance, artificial intelligence, technology, and public policy. Detailed academic records remain private.</p></article></div></Base>
